<br />


<p>Thanks for ordering from Koozie group!</p>
 <p><b>NOTIFICATION ONLY: WE ARE PROCEEDING WITH YOUR ORDER WITH THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION.</b></p>
    
   <li> Customer Name: {!relatedTo.SuppliedCompany}</li>
    

